        "created_at": "2015-10-15T21:03:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ambuscade has Charged Attacks and a Custom Hand Cannon with 4 HP in play. At the end of his turn, he deals a total of 4 damage to Tachyon, who has a Synaptic Interruption.</p>\n<p>Tachyon redirects the damage to the Hand Cannon. Then she would go on to destroy Synaptic Interruption, but the Hand Cannon is destroyed first, triggering Ambuscade to deal each target 3 damage.</p>\n<p>Tachyon redirects this damage to Ambuscade. Then she finally destroys Synaptic Interruption.</p>\n<p>I’m thinking that she could keep this going as long as she destroys Devices with each redirected hit. (Though the other heroes might not be so happy with her.)</p>\n<p>Correct?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:40.443Z",
