        "created_at": "2015-10-15T21:35:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am not sure if the Hand Cannon is destroyed before Synaptic. The video game has it destroyed when the attack is initiated, not after the attack and damage is resolved (I think).</p>\n<p>That being said, I am not 100% sure exactly when it hits the trash. For example, if you use Lightspeed Barrage on yourself then redirect it, would it be in the trash to add another damage to the new attack?</p>",
