        "id": 149630,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-10-15T21:41:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You only get one use out of synaptic per time you play it, unless the destruction is prevented, the card cannot act again once it is being destroyed.</p><p>Ambuscade's retaliation is not part of the redirection, it takes place after the redirected damage is dealt. &nbsp;Synaptic redirects and destroys itself. &nbsp;it doesn't wait for all the events to play out, it does both.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
