        "created_at": "2015-10-16T00:01:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I tried this in Mega Computer and Synaptic Interruption was destroyed before the Charged Attacks damage occurred. &nbsp;This doesn't make it the definite answer but that is how the app would handle it. &nbsp; I could see a scenario like Alacritous Subdominat where it's not destroyed fully until all the effects are finished. &nbsp;</p>",
