        "raw": "[quote=\"Pydro\"]\n\nI am not sure if the Hand Cannon is destroyed before Synaptic. The video game has it destroyed when the attack is initiated, not after the attack and damage is resolved (I think).\n\nThat being said, I am not 100% sure exactly when it hits the trash. For example, if you use Lightspeed Barrage on yourself then redirect it, would it be in the trash to add another damage to the new attack?\n\n[/quote]\nThat&#39;s how it worked in the game -- and nearly cost me a game against Baron Blade because of it.\n\nHe pulled out Devious Disruption, and it would&#39;ve done 20 damage. Blade had 20 HP left, so I just let it go hit Tachyon first. Before the damage hit, SI was destroyed and it only hit Blade for <em>19</em> damage. Luckily, it killing two of my team removed enough Ongoing and Equipment cards to let the others survive it, but it was a close one.\n",
